-- ============================================================================
-- EC6 EXPERT DEEP SEED: Field Development Planning, advanced tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed.
--
-- What this tier owns: THE VALUE UNDER SCRUTINY. The rate of return and when
-- there is none, what a sensitivity says and does not, earned value measured
-- to a stated date, what earned value refuses, and reading a plan against
-- itself.
--
-- THE ENGINE FACT THIS TIER OWNS. A rate of return is reported only when it is
-- a verified root inside the band the engine searches. The retired engine
-- reported the boundary of its own clamped search, so a project whose value is
-- negative at every rate showed an IRR of 1000.0 percent, in green.
--
-- THE TRAP THE TIER IS BUILT ON. The completion ratio is not a schedule index,
-- and an index with no denominator is null rather than zero or 1.00.
-- ============================================================================

